+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no recorded decision specifying a transport compression codec. A search of the repository's documentation and source (including `README.md` and `docs/doc.md`) turned up no policy or decision record fixing a codec for transport compression; the only related mention is a generic reference to third-party `gin-contrib` middleware that offers compression as an optional add-on, which is not a project decision. Until such a decision is recorded, no codec should be assumed.
